{
 "version": 1,
 "id": "matematicas-2006-reserva-6",
 "asignatura": "matematicas",
 "anio": 2006,
 "convocatoria": "Reserva 6",
 "documento": "MAT-2006-RESERVA_6.pdf",
 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2006-reserva-6-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=x^3+ax^2+bx+1\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Determina \\(a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\) sabiendo que la gráfica de \\(f\\) pasa por el punto \\((2,2)\\) y tiene un punto de inflexión de abscisa \\(x=0\\).",
     "(1 p.) Calcula las ecuaciones de las rectas tangente y normal a la gráfica de \\(f\\) en el punto de inflexión."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f''(x)=6x+2a\\). Inflexión en \\(x=0\\): \\(f''(0)=2a=0\\iff a=0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>En un punto de inflexión de una función dos veces derivable, \\(f''=0\\).</i>. Pasa por \\((2,2)\\): \\(8+4a+2b+1=2\\iff2b=-7\\iff b=-\\frac72\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(a=0\\), \\(b=-\\dfrac72\\): \\(f(x)=x^3-\\dfrac72x+1\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>\\(f''(x)=6x\\) cambia de signo en 0: es, efectivamente, un punto de inflexión ✓.</i></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Punto de inflexión \\((0,f(0))=(0,1)\\); \\(f'(x)=3x^2-\\frac72\\Rightarrow f'(0)=-\\frac72\\). La normal tiene pendiente \\(-\\frac1{f'(0)}=\\frac27\\).</p><div class='res'>Tangente \\(y=-\\dfrac72x+1\\); normal \\(y=\\dfrac27x+1\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "curv",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "tang",
     "apartados": "b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2006-RESERVA_6.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2006-reserva-6-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:(0,2)\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\[f(x)=\\begin{cases}\\ln x&\\text{si }0\\lt x\\leq1\\\\\\ln(2-x)&\\text{si }1\\lt x\\lt2\\end{cases}\\] siendo \\(\\ln\\) la función logaritmo neperiano.",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Estudia la derivabilidad de \\(f\\) en el punto \\(x=1\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula \\(\\displaystyle\\int_1^{1{,}5}f(x)\\,dx\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Continuidad: \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to1^-}\\ln x=0=f(1)\\) y \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to1^+}\\ln(2-x)=\\ln1=0\\). Derivadas laterales:</p>\\[f'(x)=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac1x&0\\lt x\\lt1\\\\[1mm]-\\dfrac1{2-x}&1\\lt x\\lt2\\end{cases}\\qquad f'(1^-)=1,\\quad f'(1^+)=-1\\]<div class='res'>\\(f\\) es continua pero no derivable en \\(x=1\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>En \\([1,\\,1{,}5]\\) es \\(f(x)=\\ln(2-x)\\). Con el cambio \\(u=2-x\\) (\\(du=-dx\\); \\(x=1\\Rightarrow u=1\\), \\(x=1{,}5\\Rightarrow u=\\frac12\\)):</p>\\[\\int_1^{3/2}\\ln(2-x)\\,dx=\\int_{1/2}^1\\ln u\\,du=\\bigl[u\\ln u-u\\bigr]_{1/2}^1=(0-1)-\\left(\\frac12\\ln\\frac12-\\frac12\\right)=-\\frac12+\\frac{\\ln2}2\\]<p>(\\(\\int\\ln u\\,du=u\\ln u-u\\), por partes<i class='n' data-t='th'>Integración por partes: \\(\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du\\).</i>.)</p><div class='res'>\\(\\displaystyle\\int_1^{1{,}5}f(x)\\,dx=\\frac{\\ln2-1}2\\approx-0{,}153\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "cont",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "part",
     "apartados": "b"
    },
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "def",
     "apartados": "b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2006-RESERVA_6.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2006-reserva-6-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera las matrices \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}-3\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}\\), \\(B=\\begin{pmatrix}2&1\\end{pmatrix}\\) y \\(C=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&-2\\\\6&6\\end{pmatrix}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Halla, si existe, la matriz inversa de \\(AB+C\\).",
     "(1,25 p.) Calcula, si existen, los números reales \\(x\\) e \\(y\\) que verifican: \\(C\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\end{pmatrix}=3\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\end{pmatrix}\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[AB=\\begin{pmatrix}-3\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2 & 1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-6 & -3\\\\4 & 2\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad AB+C=\\begin{pmatrix}-7 & -5\\\\10 & 8\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[|AB+C|=-56+50=-6\\neq0,\\qquad(AB+C)^{-1}=-\\frac16\\begin{pmatrix}8 & 5\\\\-10 & -7\\end{pmatrix}=\\frac16\\begin{pmatrix}-8 & -5\\\\10 & 7\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\((AB+C)^{-1}=\\dfrac16\\begin{pmatrix}-8 & -5\\\\10 & 7\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[C\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\end{pmatrix}=3\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\end{pmatrix}\\iff\\begin{cases}-x-2y=3x\\\\6x+6y=3y\\end{cases}\\iff\\begin{cases}-4x-2y=0\\\\6x+3y=0\\end{cases}\\]<p>Las dos ecuaciones son la misma, \\(y=-2x\\): infinitas soluciones.</p><div class='res'>Sí: todos los \\((x,y)=(t,-2t)\\), con \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "inv",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "ecmat",
     "apartados": "b"
    },
    {
     "tema": "sistemas",
     "tipo": "res",
     "apartados": "b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2006-RESERVA_6.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2006-reserva-6-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea la recta \\(r\\) de ecuación \\(\\dfrac{x-1}1=\\dfrac{y+2}3=\\dfrac{z-3}{-1}\\) y el plano \\(\\pi\\) de ecuación \\(x-y+z+1=0\\). Calcula el área del triángulo de vértices \\(ABC\\), siendo \\(A\\) el punto de corte de la recta \\(r\\) y el plano \\(\\pi\\), \\(B\\) el punto \\((2,1,2)\\) de la recta \\(r\\) y \\(C\\) la proyección ortogonal del punto \\(B\\) sobre el plano \\(\\pi\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(A\\)<b>:</b> \\(r\\equiv(1+t,\\,-2+3t,\\,3-t)\\) en \\(\\pi\\): \\(1+t+2-3t+3-t+1=0\\iff7-3t=0\\iff t=\\frac73\\): \\(A\\left(\\frac{10}3,5,\\frac23\\right)\\).</p><p>\\(C\\)<b>:</b> recta perpendicular a \\(\\pi\\) por \\(B\\): \\((2+s,\\,1-s,\\,2+s)\\). Corte con \\(\\pi\\): \\(2+s-1+s+2+s+1=0\\iff s=-\\frac43\\): \\(C\\left(\\frac23,\\frac73,\\frac23\\right)\\).</p><p>El triángulo es rectángulo en \\(C\\) (\\(BC\\perp\\pi\\) y \\(CA\\subset\\pi\\)):</p>\\[|\\overrightarrow{CB}|=\\frac43\\sqrt3,\\qquad\\overrightarrow{CA}=\\left(\\frac83,\\frac83,0\\right),\\ |\\overrightarrow{CA}|=\\frac83\\sqrt2,\\qquad\\text{Área}=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac{4\\sqrt3}3\\cdot\\frac{8\\sqrt2}3=\\frac{16\\sqrt6}9\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":150,\"el\":36,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[2.983,6.058,3.075],[-0.391,2.684,3.075],[1.017,1.276,0.258],[4.391,4.649,0.258]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[1.017,1.276,0.258],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"poly\",[[3.333,5,0.667],[2,1,2],[0.667,2.333,0.667]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"line\",[0.869,2.131,0.869],[1.116,2.379,0.869],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[1.116,2.379,0.869],[0.914,2.581,0.667],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[1.4,-0.8,2.6],[3.8,6.4,0.2],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[3.8,6.4,0.2],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"pt\",[3.333,5,0.667],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[2,1,2],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0.667,2.333,0.667],\"C\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 182' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m06r6a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m06r6a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m06r6a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m06r6a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='53.3,50.0 231.8,78.1 251.8,122.6 73.3,94.4' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='255.8' y='122.6' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><polygon points='82.0,106.5 242.0,45.5 223.1,128.7' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='226.0' y1='116.1' x2='212.9' y2='114.0' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='212.9' y1='114.0' x2='210.0' y2='126.6' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='314.0' y1='18.0' x2='26.0' y2='127.8' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='32.0' y='127.8' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><circle cx='82.0' cy='106.5' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='89.0' y='100.5' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='242.0' cy='45.5' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='249.0' y='39.5' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='223.1' cy='128.7' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='230.1' y='122.7' font-weight='700'>C</text><line x1='24' y1='152' x2='16.0' y2='143.9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='10.2' y='145.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='152' x2='10.1' y2='156.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='2.3' y='162.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='152' x2='24.0' y2='139.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='138.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,174)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,174)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,174)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{16\\sqrt6}9\\approx4{,}35\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
