198.6 183.5,197.1 187.7,195.4 191.9,193.4 196.1,191.3 200.3,189.0 204.5,186.5 208.6,183.8 212.8,180.8 217.0,177.7 221.2,174.4 225.4,170.8 229.6,167.1 233.8,163.2 238.0,159.0 242.2,154.7 246.3,150.2 250.5,145.4 254.7,140.5 258.9,135.3 263.1,130.0 267.3,124.4 271.5,118.7 275.7,112.7' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='63.3' cy='160.3' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='17.3' y='156.3'>(−2,3)</text><circle cx='236.7' cy='160.3' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='242.7' y='156.3'>(2,3)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 192.7H294.0M150.0 224.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='63.3' y1='189.7' x2='63.3' y2='195.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='60.3' y='206.7' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='106.7' y1='189.7' x2='106.7' y2='195.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='103.7' y='206.7' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='193.3' y1='189.7' x2='193.3' y2='195.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='190.3' y='206.7' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='236.7' y1='189.7' x2='236.7' y2='195.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='233.7' y='206.7' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='147.0' y1='138.8' x2='153.0' y2='138.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='142.8' font-size='10'>5</text><line x1='147.0' y1='84.8' x2='153.0' y2='84.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='88.8' font-size='10'>10</text><line x1='147.0' y1='30.8' x2='153.0' y2='30.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='34.8' font-size='10'>15</text></svg></div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Las dos funciones son pares: el recinto es simétrico respecto de \\(OY\\). Entre 0 y 2 va por encima \\(\\frac{15}{1+x^2}\\):</p>\\[A=2\\int_0^2\\left(\\frac{15}{1+x^2}-x^2+1\\right)dx=2\\Bigl[15\\,\\mathrm{arctg}\\,x-\\frac{x^3}3+x\\Bigr]_0^2=2\\left(15\\,\\mathrm{arctg}\\,2-\\frac83+2\\right)\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=30\\,\\mathrm{arctg}\\,2-\\dfrac43\\approx31{,}88\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
