  {
   "id": "matematicas-2006-reserva-6-8",
   "n": 8,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Halla las ecuaciones paramétricas de una recta sabiendo que corta a la recta \\(r\\) de ecuación \\(x=y=z\\), es paralela al plano \\(\\pi\\) de ecuación \\(3x+2y-z=4\\) y pasa por el punto \\(A(1,2,-1)\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La recta está en el plano \\(\\pi'\\) paralelo a \\(\\pi\\) que pasa por \\(A\\): \\(3x+2y-z+D=0\\), con \\(3+4+1+D=0\\iff D=-8\\). Corta a \\(r\\equiv(t,t,t)\\) donde \\(r\\) corta a \\(\\pi'\\):</p>\\[3t+2t-t-8=0\\iff t=2\\ \\Rightarrow\\ Q(2,2,2),\\qquad\\overrightarrow{AQ}=(1,0,3)\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-153,\"el\":34,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-0.5,-0.5,-0.5],[2.8,2.8,2.8],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[2.8,2.8,2.8],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[0.6,2.0,-2.2],[2.5,2.0,3.5],\"#e11d48\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[2.5,2.0,3.5],\"s\",\"#e11d48\",6,0],[\"poly\",[[0.329,4.7,2.385],[2.311,1.726,2.385],[1.441,1.146,-1.385],[-0.542,4.12,-1.385]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[1.441,1.146,-1.385],\"π′\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"pt\",[1,2,-1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[2,2,2],\"Q\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m06r6b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m06r6b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m06r6b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m06r6b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='197.1' y1='236.9' x2='139.1' y2='27.2' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='145.1' y='27.2' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='127.6' y1='246.0' x2='162.3' y2='18.0' stroke='#e11d48' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='168.3' y='18.0' fill='#e11d48' font-weight='700' font-style='ita